<translation id="6722744767592605627">Ungathola i-<ph name="EMAIL" />, kodwa idatha yendawo izosuswa.</translation>
<translation id="6748980958975836188">Ngifundile futhi ngavumelana <ph name="BEGIN_LINK1" />Nemigomo Nemibandela ye-Google<ph name="END_LINK1" />, <ph name="BEGIN_LINK2" />Imigomo Yesevisi ye-Chrome neye-ChromeOS Engeziwe<ph name="END_LINK2" />.</translation>
<translation id="6789834167207639931">Faka iphasiwedi yakho ye-Google Account futhi esikrinini esilandelayo ukuze uqedele ukutakula</translation>
