<translation id="7722040605881499779">Ibikade idingwa ukuze kubuyekezwe: <ph name="NECESSARY_SPACE" /></translation>
<translation id="7760176388948986635">Vumela iChromeOS nama-app e-Android, amawebhusayithi, namasevisi anemvume yendawo ukuba asebenzise indawo yale divayisi. Ukuhlonzwa Kwendawo Ngqo kunikeza indawo enembe kakhulu kuma-app namasevisi e-Android. Ukuze yenze lokhu, iGoogle ngezikhathi ezithile icubungula ulwazi olutholakala kule divayisi mayelana nezinzwa zedivayisi namasiginali angenantambo ukuze ithole izindawo ezinesiginali engenantambo ngeningi. Lokhu kusetshenziswa ngaphandle kokudalula umuntu ukuze kuthuthukiswe ukuhlonzwa kwendawo ngqo kanye namasevisi afaneleka ngokwendawo ukuze kuthuthukiswe, kuhlinzekwe, futhi kulondolozwe amasevisi eGoogle ngokuvumelana nezintshisekelo eziyimfuneko zeGoogle nezinkampani ezingahlangene ngqo zokuhlinzeka ngezidingo zabasebenzisi.</translation>
<translation id="7784875615510899699">Awunawo amalayisense atholakalayo anele okubhalisa le divayisi yeGoogle Beam. Sicela uxhumane nomthengisi wakho womkhiqizo okwesibili ukuze uthenge okwengeziwe. Uma ukholelwa ukuthi ubona lo mlayezo ngephutha, sicela uxhumane nomthengisi wakho womkhiqizo okwesibili.</translation>
<translation id="7792012425874949788">Kukhona into engahambanga kahle ngokungena ngemvume</translation>
<translation id="780301667611848630">Cha ngiyabonga</translation>
<translation id="7803657407897251194">Ukuze uqhubeke nokusetha ngedivayisi yakho ye-Android, xhuma kunethiwekhi yakho ye-<ph name="DEVICE_TYPE" /></translation>
<translation id="7851457902707056880">Ukungena ngemvume kukhawulelwe ku-akhawunti yomnikazi kuphela. Sicela uqalele phansi uphinde ungene ngemvume nge-akhawunti yomsebenzisi. Umshini uzoqalela phansi ngokuzenzakalela kumasekhondi angu-30.</translation>
<translation id="7870730066603611552">Buyekeza izinketho zokuvumelanisa ulandela ukusetha</translation>
<translation id="7883792253546618164">Zikhiphe ohlwini noma nini.</translation>
<translation id="7906440585529721295">Idatha yendawo izosulwa</translation>
